<title>USA: American Brands,spinoff done, changing name.</title>
<headline>American Brands,spinoff done, changing name.</headline>
<dateline>OLD GRENNWICH, Conn. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Brands Inc said Friday that it has completed the spinoff of its international tobacco operations, conducted through Gallaher Group Plc, to its shareholders.</p>
<p>The company also said that it will change its name to Fortune Brands Inc effective later today. Company stock, said American, will start trading under the new name on June 2, under the the ticker symbol FO.</p>
<p>Some of the consumer products company's brands include Titleist golf balls, Jim Beam liquor and Moen faucets.</p>
</text>
